==Trivia==
*King Doge's Japanese name, Wan Wan, is a pun on "One One" (referring to how he was created for the 11th anniversary event) and ''wan'', the Japanese onomatopoeia for a dog's bark.
*The texts appearing in the attack animation are "祝" "11" "周年", meaning "Celebration of the 11th anniversary".

